    <sys:String x:Key="L.About.Story">Carbonado is the black diamond, the toughest in nature: carbon compressed under immense pressure until it shines. Carbonado does the same to your images: it squeezes them to the bone without dimming their light.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="L.About.Credits">Encoders: libjxl, libavif (aom, dav1d), libwebp, oxipng, ECT, pngquant, FFmpeg. Perceptual metric: SSIMULACRA2.</sys:String>
